THIRD-PARTY DATA INCLUDED IN THIS ARCHIVE

data/b3db-raw/B3DB_classification.tsv
data/b3db-raw/B3DB_regression.tsv

    B3DB, a curated blood-brain barrier permeability database.
    Meng F, Xi Y, Huang J, Ayers PW. A curated diverse molecular database of
    blood-brain barrier permeability with chemical descriptors.
    Sci Data. 2021;8(1):289. doi:10.1038/s41597-021-01069-5
    Released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication) and
    redistributed here under those terms.

data/structures.csv contains molecule identifiers and SMILES retrieved from
ChEMBL on 17 October 2026. ChEMBL data are released under CC BY-SA 3.0.

The MIT terms above apply to the code and to the data files authored by us
(the nomination census, the agent table, the collapsing maps and the scoring
outputs). If you would prefer the data files under CC BY 4.0 instead, say so
on the Zenodo record; nothing in the archive depends on that choice.
